    "detailed_description": "Gear up to go bonkers in Elimination as you grab your friends for casual, arena-style free-for-all fun. Destroy your enemies and score points by using a variety of weapons and boobytraps across multiple stages in this cartoon-stylized game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967070/extras/5df8dba528f3bffe992b28e539b812ef.poster.avif?t=1730754813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967070/extras/5df8dba528f3bffe992b28e539b812ef.webm?t=1730754813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967070/extras/5df8dba528f3bffe992b28e539b812ef.mp4?t=1730754813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>If you like what you see, please let me know by adding this to your wishlist. It will tremendously help me in understanding the demand as how to prioritize this project. </strong><br><br><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong><br><br>He or She who defeats the most players wins the round. Don't like free-for-all? Other game modes allow the fun to continue, such as Freeze Tag, where one player is the attacker with a freeze gun and other players can unfreeze to score points. Or how about Package Pirates, a game mode about stealing others' packages scattered across the map in a race against time with other players and dropping them off at your designated drop-off point?",
    "about_the_game": "Gear up to go bonkers in Elimination as you grab your friends for casual, arena-style free-for-all fun. Destroy your enemies and score points by using a variety of weapons and boobytraps across multiple stages in this cartoon-stylized game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967070/extras/5df8dba528f3bffe992b28e539b812ef.poster.avif?t=1730754813\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967070/extras/5df8dba528f3bffe992b28e539b812ef.webm?t=1730754813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967070/extras/5df8dba528f3bffe992b28e539b812ef.mp4?t=1730754813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>If you like what you see, please let me know by adding this to your wishlist. It will tremendously help me in understanding the demand as how to prioritize this project. </strong><br><br><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong><br><br>He or She who defeats the most players wins the round. Don't like free-for-all? Other game modes allow the fun to continue, such as Freeze Tag, where one player is the attacker with a freeze gun and other players can unfreeze to score points. Or how about Package Pirates, a game mode about stealing others' packages scattered across the map in a race against time with other players and dropping them off at your designated drop-off point?",
    "short_description": "Elimination is an online, multiplayer, competitive action platform game. Use all sorts of cartoon weapons at your disposal to help you along the way in this fast-paced, arena-style online game. Just remember, the only way to victory is through elimination.",
